						<li>
                            <a href="https://www.hepb.org/news-and-events/news/guineabissaustudy/">The Hepatitis B Foundation and The African Hepatitis B Advocacy Coalition denounce the unethical HepB birth dose study in Guinea-Bissau</a>
						</li>
                    
						<li>
                            <a href="https://www.hepb.org/news-and-events/news-2/child-immunization/">Our response to proposed changes in childhood immunizations recommendations  </a>
