						</li>
                    
						<li>
                            <a href="https://www.hepb.org/news-and-events/news-2/the-hepatitis-b-foundation-introduces-an-updated-mission-statement-and-tagline-on-world-hepatitis-day-the-birthday-of-baruch-s-blumberg?stage=Stage">The Hepatitis B Foundation introduces an updated mission statement and tagline for World Hepatitis Day</a>
						</li>
                    
						<li>
                            <a href="https://www.hepb.org/news-and-events/news-2/fda-approves-first-ever-treatment-for-hepatitis-delta-offering-hope-to-80000-americans/">FDA approves first-ever treatment for hepatitis delta</a>
						</li>
                    
                </ul>
      		</div>
        </div><!--banner-->
    </div><!--banner_wrap-->

    <div id="block1_wrap" class="wrap">
        <a name="scroll_here"></a>
    	<div id="block1" class="home typography">
        	<p>We are a nonprofit organization working around the world to improve the lives of those affected by hepatitis B, hepatitis D and liver cancer; drive prevention, diagnosis and treatment and accelerate scientific research to achieve cures.</p>
        </div><!--block1-->
    </div><!--block1_wrap-->

